OL,3,APolicing minister making Commons
OL,4,Astatement after small boats protests in
OL,5,ADover and Portsmouth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere was a similar protest in Dover on
OL,8,FSaturday - the government has condemned
OL,9,F"intimidating and thuggish behaviour"
OL,10,Fat the protest in Portsmouth
OL,12,FWhat connects the protests? The BBC's
OL,13,FDaniel Sandford takes a look
OL,15,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,16,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,17,Fsmall boat arrivals, but one local says
OL,18,Fsome protesters' views made her
OL,19,F"genuinely unsettled"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
